  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Red Nacional de Jvenes Viviendo Con VIH/SIDA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young Dominicans diagnosed with HIV/AIDS face barriers to services that would improve their quality of life. Red Nacional de Jvenes Viviendo Con VIH/SIDA (REDNAJCER) analyzes, organizes, and reports on these challenges to ensure that this excluded population receives the specialized health services they need. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to strengthen governance and public health in the Dominican Republic. REDNAJCER&apos;s activities ensure healthy families and strengthen the social fabric of communities.</narrative>
  </description>
